<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Oct private credit up 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Oct private credit up 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said on Monday that private sector credit extended by financial intermediaries rose by 0.7 percent in October, seasonally-adjusted, after rising 0.5 percent in September.</p>
<p>For the year to October, credit rose by 11.3 percent, compared to 11.4 percent in September.</p>
</text>
